window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-030-fe8b0d7d5091dd3a.json"]={sha256:"fe8b0d7d5091dd3acbf6bbf9d46303ae045a367a708d4f888732c98700e663e2",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-349badf7c407fe2b","url":"https://ranger.apache.org/blogs/policy_model.html","title":"Apache Ranger policy model","titleEn":"Apache Ranger policy model","publisher":"Apache Ranger","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-030","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-030","related":[{"id":"security-v27-031","referenceUrls":["https://github.com/in-toto/specification/blob/master/in-toto-spec.md"],"title":"in-toto：獨立功能者門檻與產物規則消耗","titleEn":"in-toto: functionary thresholds and artifact-rule consumption","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：75%與87.5%可重算，剩餘漏標仍明列；報告沒有宣稱單一標籤規則涵蓋所有Ranger政策。 交付ranger-tag-coverage.csv、例外期限表及同步/匹配診斷；資料資源均為虛構名稱，不含任何PII內容。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reproduce 75 and 87.5 percent and explicitly retain the remaining missed tag. The report does not claim that one tag rule represents every Ranger authorization policy. Deliver ranger-tag-coverage.csv, the exception-expiry table and sync/matching diagnoses. Resource names are fictional and contain no personal information or real data samples.","difference":"建立兩個功能者link、核准keyid與materials/products清單；依MATCH、ALLOW及最後DISALLOW規則逐個消耗佇列，保留未被消耗的產物名稱。","differenceEn":"Build two functionary links, authorized key IDs and material/product inventories. Apply MATCH, ALLOW and a final DISALLOW rule to the artifact queue, preserving the names of products not consumed by earlier rules.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["本課計算應標PII且已正確標記的覆蓋率；缺標是分類缺口，不代表資源本來不敏感。所有例外需獨立理由及到期，不能由通過率倒推核准。 十個資源中8個經人工真值表判為PII，目前只有6個標記正確；另2個非PII保持未標記。 覆蓋率6/8×100=75%；補上一個漏標PII資源後為7/8×100=87.5%，仍有一個分類缺口。","功能者門檻與產物規則是獨立關卡；本課計算未核准產物佔比，所有名稱先正規化且不把同一路徑不同摘要合併。 單一步驟輸出10個產物，其中8個被明訂規則消耗，2個剩餘；兩位有效功能者已滿足門檻且內容一致。 剩餘比例(10−8)/10×100=20%；補上一條僅核准其中一個既定產物的精確規則後剩10%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Measure correctly tagged resources among those that should be classified PII. Missing tags are classification gaps, not proof of nonsensitivity. Exceptions require separate justification and expiry and cannot be authorized by a favorable aggregate pass rate. The independent ground-truth table identifies eight of ten resources as PII, but only six are correctly tagged. Two genuinely non-PII resources remain untagged; they must not be mixed into the PII-coverage denominator. Coverage is 6/8×100=75 percent. Correcting one missed PII tag yields 7/8×100=87.5 percent, still leaving one classification gap; a higher number does not establish complete protection.","Functionary threshold and artifact rules are independent gates. Measure the fraction of unapproved products after path normalization, while retaining different digests for an identical path rather than merging conflicting evidence into a single harmless-looking entry. One step emits ten products, eight consumed by explicit rules and two remaining. Two valid functionaries already satisfy the threshold and agree on contents, isolating artifact-policy completeness from signer-count failure. Remaining fraction is (10−8)/10×100=20 percent. Adding an exact rule approving only one previously reviewed product leaves ten percent, and the final DISALLOW still rejects the remaining unexpected output.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-040","referenceUrls":["https://github.com/notaryproject/specifications/blob/main/specs/trust-store-trust-policy.md"],"title":"Notary Project：倉庫範圍、信任身分與驗證層級","titleEn":"Notary Project: registry scopes, trusted identities and verification levels","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：75%與87.5%可重算，剩餘漏標仍明列；報告沒有宣稱單一標籤規則涵蓋所有Ranger政策。 交付ranger-tag-coverage.csv、例外期限表及同步/匹配診斷；資料資源均為虛構名稱，不含任何PII內容。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reproduce 75 and 87.5 percent and explicitly retain the remaining missed tag. The report does not claim that one tag rule represents every Ranger authorization policy. Deliver ranger-tag-coverage.csv, the exception-expiry table and sync/matching diagnoses. Resource names are fictional and contain no personal information or real data samples.","difference":"建立12個OCI產物URI與簽章描述，列registryScopes、trustStores、trustedIdentities與驗證層級；先固定所用規格版本，不假設所有版本支援相同blob範圍。","differenceEn":"Build 12 OCI artifact URIs and signature descriptors with registryScopes, trustStores, trustedIdentities and verification level. Pin the specification version and OCI scope, avoiding assumptions about blob-policy support across releases.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["本課計算應標PII且已正確標記的覆蓋率；缺標是分類缺口，不代表資源本來不敏感。所有例外需獨立理由及到期，不能由通過率倒推核准。 十個資源中8個經人工真值表判為PII，目前只有6個標記正確；另2個非PII保持未標記。 覆蓋率6/8×100=75%；補上一個漏標PII資源後為7/8×100=87.5%，仍有一個分類缺口。","本課要求命中預期倉庫政策、可信身分與指定檢查皆通過；未匹配政策不授權。此課沒有將Notation說成原生支援n-of-m多簽門檻。 12筆中10筆命中正確scope，當中7筆身分與驗證要求全符合；其他列保留無政策、錯身分或過期等具體原因。 完整通過率7/12×100≈58.333%；修正一筆scope已正確但信任store選錯的設定後為8/12×100≈66.667%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Measure correctly tagged resources among those that should be classified PII. Missing tags are classification gaps, not proof of nonsensitivity. Exceptions require separate justification and expiry and cannot be authorized by a favorable aggregate pass rate. The independent ground-truth table identifies eight of ten resources as PII, but only six are correctly tagged. Two genuinely non-PII resources remain untagged; they must not be mixed into the PII-coverage denominator. Coverage is 6/8×100=75 percent. Correcting one missed PII tag yields 7/8×100=87.5 percent, still leaving one classification gap; a higher number does not establish complete protection.","The local gate requires the intended repository policy, trusted identity and configured checks to pass. No matching policy means no approval. This exercise does not claim that the Notary trust-policy model natively supplies an n-of-m signature quorum. Ten of 12 artifacts match the correct scope, and seven of those satisfy identity and verification requirements. Preserve concrete reasons such as no policy, wrong signer or expired evidence rather than combining them into one ambiguous failure. Full acceptance is 7/12×100, approximately 58.333 percent. Repairing one correctly scoped artifact with the wrong selected trust store yields 8/12×100, approximately 66.667 percent, without widening repository scope.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-68954da34932ecc4","url":"https://github.com/in-toto/specification/blob/master/in-toto-spec.md","title":"in-toto specification: steps, thresholds and artifact rules","titleEn":"in-toto specification: steps, thresholds and artifact rules","publisher":"in-toto","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-00ba2798b5939dac","url":"https://github.com/notaryproject/specifications/blob/main/specs/trust-store-trust-policy.md","title":"Notary Project trust store and trust policy specification","titleEn":"Notary Project trust store and trust policy specification","publisher":"Notary Project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
